<title>USA: TABLE - Fund American Q2 net share loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Fund American Q2 net share loss.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, N.H. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended June 30,</p>
<p>		     1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.73	    profit$0.42</p>
<p> Net loss	  5,372	    profit3,466</p>
<p> Revs		70,198		   82,601</p>
<p> Avg		 6,727		    7,638</p>
<p>	  SIX MONTHS</p>
